<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτακτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be orderly, behave well</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.4.1
			</span></i>, etc.; of soldiers, <i>obey discipline</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.5.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. πρὸς ἀρχήν</span>
			<i>to be obedient</i> towards . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; <i>to be continent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Ench.</u>
				29.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.39.7
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>pay regularly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς φόρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHib.</u>
					1.35.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1471.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀψώνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.350.2
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως οἱ μισθοὶ τοῖς παιδευταῖς
					εὐτακτέωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					672.10
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1107.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be reduced to order</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ διανοητικοῦ ὡς ὑπό τινος
					ἰσότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					1.23
				</span></i>
			; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουμένη ἀπόβασις</span>, def. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱμαρμένη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				60
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τοῦ νοῦ λόγον -ούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					15.66
				</span></i>
			.</div>
